This is a Diwali digital-patakas browser game/site. Stack: Vite + TypeScript 
(vanilla), HTML5 Canvas 2D, Web Audio API, Pointer Events. No frameworks. 
Keep code modular (one file per pataka type). Mobile-first responsive. 
Target 60fps; cap concurrent particles. Never autoplay audio before a 
user gesture. Comment non-obvious logic.